---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Phuket to Khao Sok"
  description="Traveling from Phuket to Khao Sok? Discover bus schedules and travel times to make your journey smooth and easy."
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Phuket to Khao Sok"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Phuket To Khao Sok", "href": "/phuket-to-khao-sok/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The airport is quite a way from Phuket town center. People travelling from the airport may find themselves heading South to Phuket town in order to continue their journey from Phuket to Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Phuket to Khao Sok From the Town Center</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>The bus for Khao Sok</strong>
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>leaves from “Bus Terminal 2” in Phuket town.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>They are quite frequent and depart roughly every hour from 7am to 3pm.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Board a bus that is heading for Surat Thani, and tell the driver to stop at the Khao Sok bus station. This is the only bus route that goes directly from Phuket to Khao Sok.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <strong>How far is Khao Sok from Phuket? </strong>
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The travel time is roughly 4 hours by public bus (or 2.5 hours by private car).</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          View our Khao Sok <a href="/khao-sok-map-directions/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Map and Directions</a> page for more details.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>From the Airport</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Unfortunately, there is no regional public bus stop at the Phuket Airport. Guests traveling from Phuket Airport by public bus will face two choices.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Even though it involves heading South, the simplest option is to first take a city bus from the Airport to Phuket Bus Terminal 2 in Phuket town then follow the instructions above. It takes 30-45 minutes to reach this bus terminal from the airport.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The second option is to reach the nearest regional public bus stop from the airport, and board the Phuket to Khao Sok bus there. There is a public bus stop on the northbound lane of highway 402, about 5 kilometers from the airport. Reaching this stop can be tricky, however, and guests are advised to seek assistance from airport staff in order to find the right shuttle to this location. Taxis will charge several hundred baht for this short trip, and are best avoided where possible. Once at this stop, guests should try to board a Surat Thani-bound bus. However, guests can also board any bus passing through <a href="https://www.tourismthailand.org/Attraction/takua-pa-old-town" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Takua Pa</a> (such as the bus to Ranong or even Bangkok). In Takua Pa, guest will need to transfer to a bus heading for Surat Thani. Khao Sok is about 45 minutes from Takua Pa.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <b>Important Note: </b>The main roads of Phuket Island are heavily congested! Any guests traveling to Phuket should plan to reach their destination before 15:00. Likewise guests traveling from Phuket to Khao Sok should plan to be off the island by 15:00. Failure to do so will likely result in heavy traffic delays. This is especially true for public transportation options.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok to Phuket</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you are leaving Khao Sok to Phuket most of the information above will work in reverse.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can book minivans at the <a href="/khao-sok-map-directions/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok van station</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
